    "detailed_description": "Welcome at LiFE c.0.d.3!<br><br>A semi openworld Third Person - Action Adventure Cyberpunk/Post Apocalyptic style story game.<br>You can use multiple weapons, attachments, vehicles, close combat skills and bullet time to break through your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/ab0d0a51bbc4cb4c3f37814d734c1ec3.avif?t=1706628401\" width=548 height=86 /></span><br><br><strong>Made by <u>Mario Murkl</u></strong><br><br><br><strong>Story</strong><br><br>One day, as a result of the impact of a piece of meteorite, a virus was released. <br>The virus that brought humanity to the brink of extinction.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/288f9b1bd2032265c33752241d15dcf5.poster.avif?t=1706628401\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/288f9b1bd2032265c33752241d15dcf5.webm?t=1706628401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/288f9b1bd2032265c33752241d15dcf5.mp4?t=1706628401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br><strong>Story by <u>Alexandra Riz</u></strong><br><br>Our hero is <i>Yamato Murkl</i>, a mercenary soldier who is given a mission. <br>You have to deliver a vaccine from high city to cyber city across the desert. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/fa474bc094afbbf621105e2fa597b03c.poster.avif?t=1706628401\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/fa474bc094afbbf621105e2fa597b03c.webm?t=1706628401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/fa474bc094afbbf621105e2fa597b03c.mp4?t=1706628401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Music by <u>The Maker</u></strong><br><br>But in the desert you have to fight not only the infected. <br>Outcasts are also a danger. <br>Kill them or try to make a deal with them. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/b5516df095bac511a98547c0abbbd269.poster.avif?t=1706628401\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/b5516df095bac511a98547c0abbbd269.webm?t=1706628401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/b5516df095bac511a98547c0abbbd269.mp4?t=1706628401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The adventure reveals how Yamato became a mercenary soldier, what happened to his family, <br> who should deliver the vaccine and who caused the virus to be released.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/ed0237ffa2b990004dd661dfb552c5c2.poster.avif?t=1706628401\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/ed0237ffa2b990004dd661dfb552c5c2.webm?t=1706628401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805100/extras/ed0237ffa2b990004dd661dfb552c5c2.mp4?t=1706628401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Demo achieved with <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong><br>The Final game will be updated to <strong>Unreal Engine 5.2</strong><br><br>I released the full potential of the game engine, i used nanite, and lumen technology for the best results.<br><br>Good luck Mercenary!",
